{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet","id":1486883,"title":"Blood bags, blood potency and iron gullet.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-18T10:08:29-07:00","id":1486883,"title":"Blood bags, blood potency and iron gullet.","content":"The book says that iron gullet allows you to gain nourishment from processed blood, it also makes a difference between processed blood and unprocessed blood, specifying that at blood potency 2+, vampires gain no nourishment from unprocessed blood, does it mean that, with this merit, vampires with blood potency higher than 2 can still slake hunger from processed blood bags?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T10:20:16-07:00","id":1486885,"title":"","content":"There's a lot of problems like that with the merits, flaws, Predator types, and even default results of certain actions like ghouling someone. They all seem to assume that you will pick Humanistic tenets, and that your character will not change significantly over the course of a campaign. Iron Gullet assumes you will never get to BP 3. I mean, it's a mixed blessing at best and costs 50 xp. The game design kinda assumes you won't get much past the 50 xp mark, and will be spending it on more useful things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 07-18-2022, 01:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T12:23:38-07:00","id":1486894,"title":"","content":"I think this is meant to be &quot;canonically&quot; that processed blood can't be drunk by even high generation vampires. V5 seems heavy about encouraging you to drink &quot;from the tap.&quot;<br /> <br /> Honestly, I think it's way too harsh.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T12:37:03-07:00","id":1486896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1486894#post1486894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think this is meant to be &quot;canonically&quot; that processed blood can't be drunk by even high generation vampires. V5 seems heavy about encouraging you to drink &quot;from the tap.&quot;<br /> <br /> Honestly, I think it's way too harsh.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno. I think that feeding without a good territory available should be difficult. It emphasizes the importance of domain. There should be some real pain involved in the prince and primogen having the best territories and the neonates being restricted to the barrens. That can't happen if you can drink almost anything.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T12:38:38-07:00","id":1486897,"title":"","content":"The rules are pretty clear on this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Without the Iron Gullet Merit, vampires gain no sustenance from processed blood. Unprocessed bagged blood, as with animal blood, cannot slake any Hunger for drinkers with Blood Potency above 2. </div> </div> </div>&quot;Unprocessed blood&quot; is blood you take from a mortal or an animal and dump into a bag without treating it.<br /> <br /> And BP 3 says ...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Animal and bagged blood no longer slake any of your Hunger. </div> </div> </div>So at that point, even with Iron Gullet, no type of bagged blood sustains you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26481-tiltowait","name":"tiltowait","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26481_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T12:52:09-07:00","id":1486901,"title":"","content":"What tiltowait said. <br /> <br /> Also, I think requiring a merit is great. It requires an investment now if you want to keep some blood available without hunting. The Hunger system would be less impactful if anyone could keep a couple bags for emergencies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27145-setitefriend","name":"SetiteFriend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T13:36:15-07:00","id":1486905,"title":"","content":"Thanks, so the bagger predator type is basically useless if you get your blood potency after 3, did they even playtest this? I willl have to tell it to my player or houserule something, this will be an ancillae one shot so they already start at bp 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T14:52:33-07:00","id":1486912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1486905#post1486905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, so the bagger predator type is basically useless if you get your blood potency after 3, did they even playtest this? I willl have to tell it to my player or houserule something, this will be an ancillae one shot so they already start at bp 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not like your Predator Type enforces how you must feed.<br /> <br /> But the point is that as you get older, you need to feed on fresh blood, generally human, though animal will suffice if you develop your animalism. Or go into torpor and wake again with less restrictions after a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27145-setitefriend","name":"SetiteFriend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T15:33:55-07:00","id":1486919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SetiteFriend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1486912#post1486912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's not like your Predator Type enforces how you must feed.<br /> <br /> But the point is that as you get older, you need to feed on fresh blood, generally human, though animal will suffice if you develop your animalism. Or go into torpor and wake again with less restrictions after a while.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah but getting 2 dots of enemies for something that is temporary at best is definitely not something worth investing in, especially because you still have to hunt for it so you might just go with live humans at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-18T20:43:48-07:00","id":1486947,"title":"","content":"The restrictions on feeding in 5th Edition have resulted in a few things, I believe:<br /> <br /> * Making it much harder to believe so many vampires have managed to stay hidden. [Bad]<br /> <br /> * Making vampire population levels less believable. [Bad]<br /> <br /> * Giving a good reason to play a High Generation vampire or Thin Blood. [Good]<br /> <br /> * Making Animalism a necessity if you want to be a friendly vampire. [Neutral]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T01:05:11-07:00","id":1486973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1486947#post1486947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The restrictions on feeding in 5th Edition have resulted in a few things, I believe:<br /> <br /> * Making it much harder to believe so many vampires have managed to stay hidden. [Bad]<br /> <br /> * Making vampire population levels less believable. [Bad]<br /> <br /> * Giving a good reason to play a High Generation vampire or Thin Blood. [Good]<br /> <br /> * Making Animalism a necessity if you want to be a friendly vampire. [Neutral]</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is exactly what I thought, with these restriction and the fact that the hunger dices makes vampires into psychopaths ready to fly off the handle at any time, I really doubt that they could have survived this long, like seriously how many people vamps kill per night due to hunger? This was never hinted in oWoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T08:37:28-07:00","id":1487012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1486905#post1486905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, so the bagger predator type is basically useless if you get your blood potency after 3, did they even playtest this? I willl have to tell it to my player or houserule something, this will be an ancillae one shot so they already start at bp 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a weird take. Bagger has tradeoffs, like anything else. Its advantages include the ability to store blood for later and the ability to feed in a location of your choosing and so avoid hurting anyone if you hunger frenzy. Its disadvantage is that as your blood becomes more potent, you have a harder time drinking from bags\u2014until you can't do it at all.<br /> <br /> It makes sense, and I think it's a cool PT, because it's a microcosm of the vampiric experience. Bagger is often considered one of the less harmful PTs (though it's arguably <i>more</i> harmful), so many fledglings and players who want to play more humane characters flock to it. As time passes, though, vampiric nature forces those characters to move to something more actively predatory. The downward spiral in a nutshell.<br /> <br /> Besides, it's absurd to picture a BP 7 character feeding off of blood bags.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26481-tiltowait","name":"tiltowait","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26481_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T08:44:40-07:00","id":1487016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tiltowait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1486883-blood-bags-blood-potency-and-iron-gullet?p=1487012#post1487012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is a weird take. Bagger has tradeoffs, like anything else. Its advantages include the ability to store blood for later and the ability to feed in a location of your choosing and so avoid hurting anyone if you hunger frenzy. Its disadvantage is that as your blood becomes more potent, you have a harder time drinking from bags\u2014until you can't do it at all.<br /> <br /> It makes sense, and I think it's a cool PT, because it's a microcosm of the vampiric experience. Bagger is often considered one of the less harmful PTs (though it's arguably <i>more</i> harmful), so many fledglings and players who want to play more humane characters flock to it. As time passes, though, vampiric nature forces those characters to move to something more actively predatory. The downward spiral in a nutshell.<br /> <br /> Besides, it's absurd to picture a BP 7 character feeding off of blood bags.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think it would be much more feasible if it didn't have an enemy 2 flaw attached to it, my players agreed that it definitely is not convenient to have the mafia or other supernatural menace on your ass for something that is temporary at best.<br /> <br /> In oWoD it wasn't absurd for lower generation to feed on blood bags, if anything it was a more convenient way to not waste time playing an hunting scene and keep on with the plot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}